    <string name="faq_title">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="faq1_q">Does Godson VPN protect my connection now?</string>
    <string name="faq1_a">The app shows the real state: as long as the tunnel infrastructure is not configured (Phases 4 and 5), no tunnel is established and the status stays honest. The “Secure connection” label will only appear after a verified tunnel.</string>
    <string name="faq2_q">Why does Android ask for a VPN permission?</string>
    <string name="faq2_a">Android requires your explicit consent before an app can create a tunnel (VpnService). It is a normal system protection, requested only once.</string>
    <string name="faq3_q">Are the displayed servers real?</string>
    <string name="faq3_a">No. The current catalog is a clearly labeled demonstration. Real servers will be provided by the secure backend in Phase 4.</string>
    <string name="faq4_q">How can I maximize protection?</string>
    <string name="faq4_a">Enable “Always-on VPN” and “Block connections without VPN” in Android settings. Godson VPN is compatible with both system mechanisms.</string>
    <string name="faq5_q">What does the app store on my device?</string>
    <string name="faq5_a">Only your preferences, your favorites and a local session history (erasable). No browsing history, no personal data required.</string>
